# Copy to .env (or export these) to configure a deployed instance.

# Directory to serve. Defaults to "." (the working directory).
SNAPDROPX_DIR=.

# ⚠️ PUBLIC DEPLOYMENTS: ALWAYS SET THIS. ⚠️
# SNAPDROPX_AUTH is the username + password that gates EVERY file-serving
# route on the deployed app (browse, download, preview, zip, upload,
# delete, mkdir, rename, and all /api/* routes). An unauthenticated
# visitor gets a browser login prompt and a 401 response — no files.
# NEVER deploy publicly without it. Local LAN-only use may run without
# auth, public use must not.
# Format: "username:password" (exactly one colon separates the two).
SNAPDROPX_AUTH=

# Port for the server process. Only used by the uvicorn command line
# (Dockerfile / Procfile / render.yaml); the app itself does not read it.
SNAPDROPX_PORT=8000

# Per-file upload size cap in megabytes. Defaults to 100.
SNAPDROPX_MAX_UPLOAD_MB=100
